The APCA algorithm constants in scripts/contrast.py are transcribed from
APCA-W3 (https://github.com/Myndex/apca-w3) by Andrew Somers / Myndex Research,
which is distributed under the W3 license. APCA is a trademark of Myndex
Research. This is an independent implementation and is not endorsed by, nor
affiliated with, Myndex Research or the W3C.

Per the APCA license terms, this implementation is intended for web content on
self-illuminated displays. It is not authorized for medical, clinical
evaluation, human safety, aerospace, transportation, or military applications.
